{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220710","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220710","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322071001:1":{"text":"戴蒙，我们给你找了几个玩伴，快出来玩吧，好不好？","source_cn":"戴蒙，我们给你找了几个玩伴，快出来玩吧，好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2517B1F26CA23B57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322071002:1":{"text":"这些小雪人很可爱，外面很热闹……你听到它们的笑声了吧？","source_cn":"这些小雪人很可爱，外面很热闹……你听到它们的笑声了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12891CF1116F1442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322071003:1":{"text":"戴蒙……还在生气吗？","source_cn":"戴蒙……还在生气吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E90121EAADF503","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322071004:1":{"text":"无论雪米拉和尼汝说什么，戴蒙都不肯出来，也不愿说一句话。","source_cn":"无论雪米拉和尼汝说什么，戴蒙都不肯出来，也不愿说一句话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF1BB213199E3342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322071005:1":{"text":"戴蒙……唉……别生爸爸妈妈的气了，好不好？","source_cn":"戴蒙……唉……别生爸爸妈妈的气了，好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x993B797034ED1F07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat